<thead><tr><th>Cost component</th><th>What to model</th><th>Common failure</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Platform subscription</td><td>Plan tier at realistic contact volume</td><td>Buying the tier for a list you do not have yet</td></tr>
<tr><td>Contact or send overages</td><td>Growth rate against plan limits</td><td>Seasonal spikes triggering surprise invoices</td></tr>
<tr><td>SMS credits</td><td>Opt-in rate times messages per journey</td><td>Assuming SMS converts like email at a fraction of cost</td></tr>
<tr><td>Discount budget</td><td>Discount depth times expected redemption</td><td>Flows that train customers to wait for codes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Creative and ops time</td><td>Hours per week to maintain flows</td><td>Underestimating editing and QA workload</td></tr>
