<li>Document consent sources and map them into the platform before any campaign.</li>
<li>Verify Shopify order, cart, refund, and support events fire in a test store.</li>
<li>Build suppression rules and exit conditions before building any flow.</li>
<li>Launch one bounded pilot journey with a holdout group for measurement.</li>
<li>Review margin, complaints, unsubscribes, and repeat purchase after thirty days.</li>
<li>Expand only when the pilot can be edited safely by a second operator.</li>
